    pr_ref:  # 06f8
    description: "When pytest fails but pytest-retry succeeds and ci-complete passes, ci-debug status reports 'Overall: failure'. This is misleading — CI actually passed. The script should check ci-complete status and report 'Overall: success (recovered)' when ci-complete succeeds despite individual job failures. Additionally, Codeberg branch protection may need reconfiguration to gate on ci-complete rather than all individual jobs, since the retry mechanism exists specifically to handle flaky failures. Both ci-debug and merge-pr are governance files requiring human approval."  # 06f8
    fields: {}  # 06f8
